{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_headbr_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_headbr_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "強中自有強中手",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_headbr_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3c26358103d1bdb1463546a42424dc235aa0aa73054d0fe991ba65c3b82310cf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "啊，太好了，凜冬，烈夏，快過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "快點，別愣著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "怎麼，是要幫忙打架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "打架？來了來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "不是，聽我說——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "不知道哪個缺心眼的跑到杜賓面前炫耀零食去了，現在訓練室裡有幾個剛來的感染者小孩上入門健身興趣課，拜託你們照顧一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "哦哦，零食網路！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......照顧小孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "注意事項我寫在便條上了——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "拜託你們——到時候請你們吃飯——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "哇哦，跑得好快，堅雷教官是庫蘭塔嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "照顧小孩子為什麼找我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "......對哦，為什麼找我們，我們倆看起來像是會帶小孩的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "而且給一群剛被接來羅德島的小孩上課，呃呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嘖，好麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......呿，也就一天，咬咬牙就過去了。走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "......哈哈，那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "冬將軍英明神武十分厲害所向披靡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "啊？你跑什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我會給你留蜂蜜的！我才不要帶小孩子上課，這活你接！就這麼定了，加油——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "喂！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "*烏薩斯粗口*好煩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（上課，想著就頭疼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（......哦，聽起來不是很鬧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（那還好。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "來來來，看我，都聽我號令！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "就你剛才那樣子還想當大哥？我一拳就打趴下了！但你還不錯，從今天起你就是我的一號小弟了！你是二號，你是三號！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "這裡就是我的新地盤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "呦，剛進來的這一個！來得最晚，你就當我們最小的小弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "以後都要叫我大姐頭，聽到了沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（哦呦？把這一群都打服了，她挺厲害的哦。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（不對不能這麼想，我是來管他們的......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "小手小腳的，瞎高興什麼呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（這種情況，打一頓或許能聽話？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（不行，不能打，我是來教他們的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哎，你們，聽好！你們的教官有點事情，今天我來照管你們一天。都好好聽話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "便條......在這裡。哎，你，剛才亂叫的那個，從掩體上下來！站那麼高摔下來可別哭，我可不是什麼醫療幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你這個小弟在對大姐頭說什麼！誰會哭？我才不會摔下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "說得對！說得對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（啊，忍住，不能打，不能打。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "“保證他們安全的同時教會器械的名字以及它們的用法，也可以讓他們上手練練，一定注意安全！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（堅雷教官這字真的是都要飛出去了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "喂，來吧，堅雷教官給你們留的作業......你怎麼還在掩體上站著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "麻煩死了......好好聽話，下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "不下！這裡是只有大姐頭才能上來的地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "沒錯！沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（真的好想上去打她一頓！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我是來替教官照看你的，你站上面危險，快下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "哼，那又怎樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......聽話！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你是我小弟我為什麼要聽你的，我是大姐頭，你應該聽我的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "聽大姐頭的！聽大姐頭的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "啊？我應該聽你的？你是不是真的想讓我揍你啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你打不過我~我會用法術打你！你沒長石頭你不會吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（哇這小孩，又不能打！啊，好想回去把烈夏抓回來打一頓——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "而且我厲害得很，才不要你照看，我要教官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "教官讓我管你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你是小弟我不要你管！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（這孩子越凶越不聽話啊？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（早露在就好了，我又做不來她那種好學生大姐姐的樣子，這個小孩不聽我的其他的就更不會聽了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（這樣下去沒完了......得讓她服我才行。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你厲害嗎？我不覺得你厲害，教官都讓我來管你了，我就比你厲害，我才是這裡的大姐頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你胡說！我才是大姐頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我不服你，要不我們打個賭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "打賭！打賭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我賭你絕對贏不過我，你要是輸了就乖乖聽我話，你贏了，我就做你小弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你本來就是我小弟，我才不賭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "對啊我本來就是你小弟，我......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（我繞進去了？啊！好煩！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......你不賭你就是膽小鬼，最小的小弟，你是覺得肯定贏不了才不賭的，你就不配做大姐頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "我就是大姐頭，你才是小弟！賭就賭！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你擅長什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "抓石子！我抓石子最最最厲害！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你到時候乖乖叫我大姐頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "走，說好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "比賽！比賽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "得讓你這個大姐頭看一下，什麼才叫作真正的大姐頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（我之前抓石子玩過多少次了，這小丫頭肯定贏不過我......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我開始了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（往上拋，接住......反手，再接，再拋，一個、兩個、三個、一個......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "哼！第一關誰不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "好，第二關~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（拋，接住兩個，拋，抓一接一，拋，再接住......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "掉掉掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（哪那麼容易就掉！這小丫頭真的......？哦？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（一個、兩個、三個、一個......好了好了，第二關過了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯，第三關。拋、抓，兩個、三個、一個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "掉！掉！掉呀！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "都接住了哦~我要開始最後一關了哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "哼，就這誰不會~我也行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（呼——平靜一下。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（好，開始！抓七個，拋！接住，拋四個，再抓住，再拋，接，三、二、一，成了！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "最後一下了哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（八個，反手，接住！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "掉了兩個掉了兩個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "兩個！兩個！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哎呀，失誤了，不過也還行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "該你了，來吧小丫頭，讓我看看你抓得怎麼樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "哼，不用你說，我開始了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "而且，不要叫我小丫頭，要叫我大姐頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "行，大姐頭，開始！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（哦哦哦她確實玩得不錯......動作挺俐落啊，怪不得敢那樣說......確實挺厲害啊，要結束了要結束了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哦！你掉了三個！你輸了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "行吧，過來聽話。然後，不許再爬到掩體上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "你、你耍賴！剛才那個不算！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我耍賴？你才耍賴吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "誰耍賴！誰耍賴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "我是大姐頭我才不會耍賴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大姐頭不會耍賴！大姐頭不會耍賴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，不服再來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "一二三四五六七......你抓住了七個，進步了啊？但我八個，你又輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "來，聽話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（啊？我好不容易想的辦法，這孩子怎麼說話不算話。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（現在小孩都這樣嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......不說話算話的話，你那些......一號二號小弟，就不把你當大姐頭了哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "好吧，要幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "認識器械名和它們的用法，如果喜歡你們可以上手練練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "那開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的大姐頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（臉都垮了，這是傷心了？小孩子果然就是好麻煩！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "那個，你抓石子其實挺厲害的，只是我玩的時間更長，就更熟練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你最後拋的時候抖下手腕，石子就會這樣——稍稍分個前後，用手背接起來就不會那麼分散，就能接到更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "一二三四五六七八......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "嘿，真的欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "♪~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "是很有用吧？不垮臉了？那我們開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "好好學！乖乖等堅雷教官回來，我就教你個頂級抓石子秘訣，把那個練好了，你打遍天下無敵手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "騙你幹什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "好欸！！姐姐真好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "姐姐真好！姐姐真好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我又不教你們，瞎叫什麼？都來聽我講課！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "（哈。這就叫姐姐了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "來，開始吧，都來好好聽。這個是杠鈴，這邊這個立架叫“史密斯架”，把杠鈴杆固定在這邊這個軌道裡以後，會怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......杠鈴就拿不走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "啊？不是，史密斯架會限制杠鈴的滑動軌跡，這樣在做訓練時杠鈴就不會前後擺動，能避免對你的腰或者膝蓋造成傷害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "像這樣，可以做深蹲......這樣拿著，然後保證膝蓋不要超過腳尖，呼氣蹲下，吸氣起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "也可以躺臥在這裡，往上推舉，鍛煉上肢力量。但是訓練時要注意，如果選用重量太大的杠鈴而又無法支撐，壓下來的話你就會，咔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "所以要十分小心，記住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "記住了！杠鈴不能太重，否則我們會被壓斷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯？嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "也對，杠鈴太重會壓斷你們，所以很危險，鍛煉時要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "然後這個是單雙杠引體向上架。背對支撐點，雙手抓住抓手，然後胳膊架在橫樑上，身體懸空，像這樣捲腹，鍛煉你的腹部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯......練這個不會輕易受傷，有人想試試嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "嗯，我要試試！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "有點高，我扶你上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "抓住這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "對，然後胳膊肘放上去，支撐自己的身體......可以做到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "可以！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "固定住自己的上半身，腰背挺直，腹部用力，腿繃直用腹部力量抬起來，吸氣，呼氣......對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "（抖抖抖抖抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哎呀，你胳膊這裡源石都長出來了，別磕到......這裡會痛嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "不要碰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "在立架上別亂動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "亂動傷到自己怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......姐姐沒有長石頭吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......沒有，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "那姐姐離我遠點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......先從立架上下來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我為什麼要離你遠點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "因為我得病了，別人都躲著我，還拿石頭砸我。你又沒長石頭，你為什麼不離我遠點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "想什麼呢，這裡長石頭的人多了去了，堅雷教官沒和你說嗎？好好訓練！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "他們拿石頭砸你你打回去了沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "打回去了！狠狠地打了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "好樣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......呃，但打架還是不好的，以後不能再亂打架了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯......就是不好啦，聽話，以後不要隨便打架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "行吧，這個器械先練到這裡，標準的動作堅雷教官之後會再教你們，我把剩下的器械都給你們說一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "姐姐，你叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯？我叫......凜冬。我的代號是，凜冬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "代號？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "對，我現在叫凜冬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "我還沒有代號......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "等我想好了以後就告訴姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哈哈，好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "好！教完了，都記住了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "那當然，我多聰明！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "都記住啦！都記住啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "要是喜歡的話，以後就繼續跟著堅雷教官上這個課，憑興趣學一些鍛煉身體的方法也挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "不只是堅雷教官，還有其他幹員也會開一些入門興趣課，感興趣的話都可以去聽聽看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "羅德島還有挺多和你們年齡差不多的人，也可以找他們玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "結束了，現在就等堅雷教官回來吧，我來教你那個抓石子的超絕技巧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "超絕技巧！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "我也要學！我也要學！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "好，都過來，就是這樣，你們只需要在這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "哎呀，我回來了，問題解決了！萬事大吉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "教官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "教官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "啊凜冬，今天辛苦了，待會請你吃晚飯~欸，烈夏呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哈，她一聽看小孩，一早就跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "哈哈哈，那今天吃晚飯就沒她的份囉~給我講講吧，今天課上得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "教官，我把器械的名稱和用法都教給他們了，他們也上手練了幾個，做得都挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "不錯不錯，接下來就是我的工作了，你先休息休息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯，我去把器械收拾一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "孩子們，過來吧，我檢查一下你們的學習成果，今天就可以結束啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "......嗯。這個是杠鈴，在立架裡放好，可以固定住，這樣子鍛煉腿上的肌肉，在這裡躺著做推舉的話，可以鍛煉胳膊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "這個是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "那個是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "不錯，記得都挺清楚的。練過以後身上有哪裡疼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "來，讓我再檢查檢查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "嗯，都沒受傷，很不錯~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "那今天就到這裡啦，你們都回宿舍好好休息，晚上可以去食堂吃點自己喜歡的，四處轉轉也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "走吧~解散！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小孩們",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "教官再見，凜冬姐姐再見~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "再見~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯，再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "那凜冬姐姐是不是要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "是的~今天是特殊情況，凜冬已經完成任務了，以後都是我來給你們上課。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "那......凜冬姐姐以後可以來和我一起上課嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "小丫頭意外地還挺黏你的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "啊......啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "凜冬姐姐以後不來了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "啊，對，我只是今天偶然來幫忙而已，這些知識對我來說太基礎了。所以以後就......嗯......以後就不會來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你好好聽教官話，適應羅德島的生活就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "哈哈，挺有意思，我倒是沒有想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "小丫頭，她給你說什麼了，你這麼喜歡她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "凜冬姐姐說以後不要亂打架，打架不好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "嗯嗯......哦哦......凜冬說不要打架......噗，好，走吧走吧，回宿舍歇著吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "嗯......教官再見，凜冬姐姐再見......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "凜冬姐姐......我後天上課也是在這個訓練室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "哎呀，跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "看你樣子沒聽懂啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "她的意思是下回也想讓你來呀，哈哈哈，你到底做什麼了，小姑娘這麼喜歡你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "我怎麼沒有這種待遇？......難道我看起來很凶嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "欸欸？有人找我......啊，我得先走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "這是我的員工卡，拿去吃晚飯吧，回頭放我宿舍門口就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "吃點好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯，謝謝教官！教官再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "哈哈！找了你半天，原來你在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "我帶來了風味蜜飲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "切！你還好意思來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "別這樣嘛！這可是我珍藏了好久的呢！一起喝囉~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哼，你跑了，我和一堆小孩子待一天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈我們冬將軍也會帶小孩啊~哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......哪像夏將軍還會逃跑呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀都拿了蜜飲來了怎麼還咬著不放......喝喝喝！算我給你賠罪啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "好喝吧！說了是我珍藏的呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯......是挺好喝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "來，講講你今天帶小孩都發生了什麼事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "能有什麼，就是給他們上課。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "但是......挺奇怪的，今天有個小姑娘好像挺喜歡我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "小姑娘喜歡你？你該不會是把人家打了一頓，嚇得她不敢不聽你的話吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "你找打啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "哎哎哎不是不是你說你說我聽著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "就是......她下課之後不想讓我走，還說想讓我下節課也去陪她一起上......我肯定不會去的，那些東西我都會，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "怎麼了，你今天怎麼怪怪的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我搞不懂為什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "什麼為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "她好像真的挺喜歡我的......？為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "我以為我那麼凶，還玩遊戲贏她讓她丟臉，討厭說不上，我以為她不會有多喜歡我來著......但是剛才她還想讓我下節課也去陪她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "而且我覺得我之前有那樣，那些......你知道的。但是她好像就也不關心，就是很想讓我再去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "咕咚咕咚咕咚......唉！我以為啥呢！你想那麼多幹什麼，那她就是覺得你好就喜歡你囉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "而且她為什麼不喜歡你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "那她就是喜歡你囉！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "這還在食堂裡你小聲一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "呃，別晃我！我喝......我頭頭頭暈我去買瓶水緩緩......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "char_194_rosali",
      "text": "你你你在這裡等我一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "切，醉蜜還這麼貪，哪天醉到從艦上掉下去都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嗯......風味蜜飲，還真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "呃，有點頭暈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......對哦，她為什麼不喜歡我呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "其實我不用在意那些事情的......那些......那些......那個小丫頭根本就不在意啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "......不在意啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩天后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "好，今天的課程開始~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "教官好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅雷",
      "speakerId": "char_260_durnar",
      "text": "怎麼無精打采的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "嗯......沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "猜猜是誰來了——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凜冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_115_headbr_1",
      "text": "哈哈！你凜冬姐來啦！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "？？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者小女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "——耶！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
